# Ripgrep (agent Grep, `rg`) reads this on top of .gitignore.

# Generated models and blockstates stay searchable; only the datagen cache is hidden.
!src/generated/
src/generated/resources/.cache/

# Extracted Minecraft and NeoForge Java and the vanilla textures and models of this project version
# (see VERSION.txt): .gitignore keeps them out of git, this file keeps them searchable.
# Both are links to shared caches, and ripgrep does not follow links found while walking:
# search them as a path, `rg <pattern> .mc-sources`, or with `rg -L`.
!.mc-sources/
!.vanilla-textures/
